      <scope classrefs="object" doc="High-performance profiler object. Methods:  close():      Stop the profiler and close the log files. fileno():     Returns the file descriptor of the log file. runcall():    Run a single function call with profiling enabled. runcode():    Execute a code object with profiling enabled. start():      Install the profiler and return. stop():       Remove the profiler.  Attributes (read-only):" ilk="class" name="ProfilerType">
