    <scope doc="Generic MIME writer. This module defines the class MimeWriter.  The MimeWriter class implements a basic formatter for creating MIME multi-part files.  It doesn&apos;t seek around the output file nor does it use large amounts of buffer space. You must write the parts out in the order that they should occur in the final file. MimeWriter does buffer the headers you add, allowing you to rearrange their order." ilk="blob" lang="Python" name="MimeWriter">
