    <scope doc="CSV parsing and writing. This module provides classes that assist in the reading and writing of Comma Separated Value (CSV) files, and implements the interface described by PEP 305.  Although many CSV files are simple to parse, the format is not formally defined by a stable specification and is subtle enough that parsing lines of a CSV file with something like line.split(&quot;,&quot;) is bound to fail.  The module supports three basic APIs: reading, writing, and registration of dialects.   DIALECT REGISTRATION:" ilk="blob" lang="Python" name="csv">
