      <scope doc="This class is used for creating reports from data generated by the Profile class.  It is a &quot;friend&quot; of that class, and imports data either by direct access to members of Profile class, or by reading in a dictionary that was emitted (via marshal) from the Profile class.  The big change from the previous Profiler (in terms of raw functionality) is that an &quot;add()&quot; method has been provided to combine Stats from several distinct profile runs.  Both the constructor and the add() method now take arbitrarily many file names as arguments.  All the print methods now take an argument that indicates how many lines" ilk="class" line="43" lineend="451" name="Stats">
