      <scope classrefs="int" doc="bool(x) -&gt; bool Returns True when the argument x is true, False otherwise. The builtins True and False are the only two instances of the class bool. The class bool is a subclass of the class int, and cannot be subclassed." ilk="class" name="BooleanType">
