      <scope doc="Base class to support delegation for augmented assignment nodes To generator code for augmented assignments, we use the following wrapper classes.  In visitAugAssign, the left-hand expression node is visited twice.  The first time the visit uses the normal method for that node .  The second time the visit uses a different method that generates the appropriate code to perform the assignment. These delegator classes wrap the original AST nodes in order to support the variant visit methods." ilk="class" line="1492" lineend="1507" name="Delegator">
