      <scope doc="Class implementing sets of integers. This is an efficient representation for sets consisting of several continuous ranges, e.g. 1-100,200-400,402-1000 is represented internally as a list of three pairs: [(1,100), (200,400), (402,1000)].  The internal representation is always kept normalized.  The constructor has up to three arguments: - the string used to initialize the set (default &apos;&apos;), - the separator between ranges (default &apos;,&apos;) - the separator between begin and end of a range (default &apos;-&apos;) The separators must be strings (not regexprs) and should be different." ilk="class" line="767" lineend="899" name="IntSet">
