    <scope doc="TELNET client class. Based on RFC 854: TELNET Protocol Specification, by J. Postel and J. Reynolds  Example:  &gt;&gt;&gt; from telnetlib import Telnet &gt;&gt;&gt; tn = Telnet(&apos;www.python.org&apos;, 79)   # connect to finger port &gt;&gt;&gt; tn.write(&apos;guido\r\n&apos;) &gt;&gt;&gt; print tn.read_all() Login       Name               TTY         Idle    When    Where" ilk="blob" lang="Python" name="telnetlib">
