      <scope classrefs="object" doc="enumerate(iterable) -&gt; iterator for index, value of iterable Return an enumerate object.  iterable must be an other object that supports iteration.  The enumerate object yields pairs containing a count (from zero) and a value yielded by the iterable argument.  enumerate is useful for obtaining an indexed list: (0, seq[0]), (1, seq[1]), (2, seq[2]), ..." ilk="class" name="enumerate">
