      <scope doc="class FileInput([files[, inplace[, backup[, mode[, openhook]]]]]) Class FileInput is the implementation of the module; its methods filename(), lineno(), fileline(), isfirstline(), isstdin(), fileno(), nextfile() and close() correspond to the functions of the same name in the module. In addition it has a readline() method which returns the next input line, and a __getitem__() method which implements the sequence behavior. The sequence must be accessed in strictly sequential order; random access and readline() cannot be mixed." ilk="class" line="184" lineend="375" name="FileInput" signature="class FileInput([files[, inplace[, backup[, mode[, openhook]]]]])">
