      <scope classrefs="object" doc="int(x[, base]) -&gt; integer Convert a string or number to an integer, if possible.  A floating point argument will be truncated towards zero (this does not include a string representation of a floating point number!)  When converting a string, use the optional base.  It is an error to supply a base when converting a non-string. If the argument is outside the integer range a long object will be returned instead." ilk="class" name="IntType">
