    <scope doc="Package Install Manager for Python. This is currently a MacOSX-only strawman implementation. Despite other rumours the name stands for &quot;Packman IMPlementation&quot;.  Tools to allow easy installation of packages. The idea is that there is an online XML database per (platform, python-version) containing packages known to work with that combination. This module contains tools for getting and parsing the database, testing whether packages are installed, computing dependencies and installing packages.  There is a minimal main program that works as a command line tool, but the" ilk="blob" lang="Python" name="pimp">
