    <scope doc="terminalcommand.py -- A minimal interface to Terminal.app. To run a shell command in a new Terminal.app window:  import terminalcommand terminalcommand.run(&quot;ls -l&quot;)  No result is returned; it is purely meant as a quick way to run a script with a decent input/output window." ilk="blob" lang="Python" name="terminalcommand">
